   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,000eb (Very Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Clinic</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p><em>Enhances the user’s perception of machines via a drive of databases and deep-scan algorithms embedded into their frontal cortex.</em></p>\n<p>Neuralware. Requires 2 Neuralware Option Slots. Increases the user’s TECH by 2, to a maximum of 8. Whenever the user is providing a Complementary Bonus to any TECH-based Skill Check made by another character, the bonus they provide is increased by 1 (+2 Total).</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Neuralware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 2</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The TECH increase and its cap at 8 are automated. The Complementary Bonus increase is applied by hand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
